  "description": "The three kingdoms, the era where heroes flocked in order to defeat the world. The best-armed follicles got lost in history due to a momentary mistake. The last moments of life… \n\n*“Give me one more chance, I promise I’ll defeat the world!”* \n\nWhen I opened my eyes, the follicle was in its twenties. It went back in time, with its tumultuous spirit beginning to unfold! \n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
